From: Lumia 1520 mainline port
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] slimbus: WCD9320 codec core

Supplies, reset, SLIMbus binding, regmap, read-only parent-interrupt
observation, automatic idempotent CDC-core initialisation with all three
stage snapshots readable, and a nested IRQ chip description that is
deliberately not registered yet.

diff -uprN orig/drivers/slimbus/Kconfig new/drivers/slimbus/Kconfig
--- orig/drivers/slimbus/Kconfig	2026-07-31 16:05:21.716434993 -0400
+++ new/drivers/slimbus/Kconfig	2026-08-15 19:35:40.309873100 -0400
@@ -34,4 +34,42 @@ config SLIM_QCOM_NGD_CTRL
 	  communicating with slave HW directly over the bus using messaging
 	  interface, and communicating with master component residing on ADSP
 	  for bandwidth and data-channel management.
+
+config SLIM_WCD9320
+	tristate "WCD9320 (Taiko) codec core"
+	depends on GPIOLIB && REGULATOR
+	depends on SND_SOC
+	select REGMAP
+	select REGMAP_SLIMBUS
+	select REGMAP_IRQ
+	help
+	  Core support for the Qualcomm WCD9320 "Taiko" audio codec attached
+	  over SLIMbus: regulators, reset sequencing, SLIMbus device up/down
+	  handling, register map and identity validation.
+
+	  Registers an ASoC component with one playback DAI and can program a
+	  SLIMbus RX slave port. It still implements no audio path: no channel
+	  is allocated on the bus and no samples move.
+
+	  If unsure, say N.
+
+config SLIM_WCD9320_LUMIA_CARD
+	tristate "Minimal ASoC card for the WCD9320 on Lumia RM-940"
+	depends on SLIM_WCD9320
+	depends on SND_SOC
+	help
+	  A laboratory fixture: a minimal sound card that binds the WCD9320
+	  RX DAI against ASoC's dummy CPU DAI and dummy platform, so that the
+	  framework itself invokes the codec's hw_params().
+
+	  There is no DMA and no audio path. A PCM node appears and can be
+	  configured, but samples cannot be written, because the dummy
+	  platform preallocates no buffer. This exists to prove ASoC lifecycle
+	  and callback provenance, not to play audio.
+
+	  It is a separate module from the codec on purpose, so that replacing
+	  the dummy CPU with a real q6/AFE one later does not touch the codec
+	  driver.
+
+	  If unsure, say N.
 endif
